  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "**Logic : [Square of (Second number - 1)] + 1 = First number**\n\nSo,\n\n \n• 26 : 6\n\n⇒(6 - 1)² + 1 = 26\n\n⇒(5)² + 1 = 26\n\n⇒25 + 1 = 26\n\n⇒26 = 26 (LHS = RHS)\n\n \n• 37 : 7\n\n​⇒(7 - 1)² + 1 = 37\n\n⇒(6)² + 1 = 37\n\n⇒36 + 1 = 37\n\n⇒37 = 37 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSimilarly,\n\n \n• ? : 11\n\n​⇒(11 - 1)² + 1 = ?\n\n⇒(10)² + 1 = ?\n\n⇒100 + 1 = ?\n\n⇒**? = 101**\n\nHence, **\"101\"** is the correct answer.\n\n2f",
